      "t": "2026-11-18T00:00:01Z",
      "text": "Israel is reported to be delaying building contracts for West Bank settlements after UK sanctions, according to The Guardian.",
      "cites": [
        "news:guardian:c909e9e5ddfb"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-18T00:00:09Z",
      "text": "Al Jazeera also reported on the story.",
      "cites": [
        "news:aljazeera:a863809b118e"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-18T00:00:26Z",
      "text": "The West Bank is the larger of the two Palestinian territories that make up Palestine, the other being the Gaza Strip.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:rev:1386040821:0"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-18T00:00:37Z",
      "text": "Records list the West Bank in the Southern Levant, and founded in 1949.",
      "cites": [
        "wd:Q36678:P276",
        "wd:Q36678:P571"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-18T00:00:56Z",
      "text": "The Guardian headlined its report, “Israel delays building contracts for West Bank settlement after UK sanctions.”",
      "cites": [
        "news:guardian:c909e9e5ddfb"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-18T00:01:03Z",
      "text": "Al Jazeera headlined its report, “Israeli settler kills Palestinian grandmother in occupied West Bank.”",
      "cites": [
        "news:aljazeera:a863809b118e"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-18T00:01:12Z",
